Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: the update card opens the download of this platform

For upstream a branded client is a custom client and hides the update card.
Show it, and open the download page of our API server for this platform
(Windows 64 or 32 bits, Mac Intel or Apple Silicon) instead of rustdesk.com.
The in-app update stays off: upstream restricts it to GitHub releases.
